
<div class="focus-details unsaved-record">
  <div id="new-user-form-container" class="new-record-form-container">

    <h4>New User</h4>

    <div id="new-user-form-explanation" class="alert alert-info" role="note">
      <p><strong>Adding someone here does not let them log in to the Editor.</strong></p>
      <p>
        Logins are set up separately, in ActiveDirectory (the network login
        system). A person can only log in once they have been given access there.
      </p>
      <p>
        Use this form only if you want to give someone permissions in the
        Editor, such as reviewing batches or working on a product, before they
        log in for the first time.
      </p>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Enter their user name exactly as they type it when they log in.</li>
        <li>
          You don't need this form for someone who has already logged in.
          The Editor adds them automatically the first time they log in.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr>
    <%= render partial: 'form' %>

  </div>
</div>
